%N A366200 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = 1 + x*(1 + x)^3*A(x)^3.
%F A366200 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(3*k,n-k) * binomial(3*k,k)/(2*k+1).
%F A366200 D-finite with recurrence 2*n*(2*n+1)*a(n) +-(n+2)*(7*n-5)*a(n-1) +4*(-50*n^2+154*n-129)*a(n-2) +6*(-99*n^2+441*n-505)*a(n-3) +12*(-63*n^2+360*n-518)*a(n-4) +3*(-153*n^2+1053*n-1792)*a(n-5) -12*(3*n-10)*(3*n-14)*a(n-6)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 04 2026
%o A366200 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(3*k, n-k)*binomial(3*k, k)/(2*k+1));
